{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/gettingstarted"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/GettingStarted"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"role":"article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)"},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}]},{"text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Embed the Certificate","anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Fetch a Session Token","anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Perform a "},{"code":"POST","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request to the following endpoint:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Environment","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URL"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Test"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Live","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/authe-live.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Headers:"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Content-Type: application\/json"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body:"}]}]},{"code":["{","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The required "},{"code":"roles","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Import-the-SDK","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Import the SDK"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This gives you access to all public types, including ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"Configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProvisioningSession"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not import ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore"},{"text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators.","type":"text"}]}]},{"anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider","text":"Implement a Token Provider","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Device Testing Requirements","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Release build on a physical device","type":"text"}]},{"text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Next-Steps","level":2,"text":"Next Steps","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardProvisioningGuide"},{"text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/SessionsProvisioningGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/OfflineProvisioningGuide","isActive":true},{"text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide","